Hypothesis A1 : a1 = Z_to_bv 64 req.
Hypothesis HK : forall st1 idx s' ms',
ras_post2 ra sp gp tp s0 s1 s2 s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 F fc o m st0 st s lo sc req st1 idx s' ms' ->
rimplT o (k st1 idx) s' Q ms'.
