sc mm (slot_of st3 g3 idx) cnt1 (cnt1 - 1) (as_kq sc k bail)) s'' Q
(MS (rnest_regs st2 mm cnt1 (Z_to_bv 64 idx) t0' t1' t2' a1' a2' a3' a4' a5' a6' a7' t3' t4' t5' t6')
